        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Operation Strangle, the ground assault operation, the conflict where Dave Schreiner was mortally wounded\n- People: Dave Schreiner\n- Topics: World War II airstrikes\n\nFacts:\n- During World War II, Operation Strangle involved airstrikes.\n- The operation described in the chunk was successful because of the airstrikes of Operation Strangle.\n- The ground assault of the operation described in the chunk occurred before the conflict in which Dave Schreiner was mortally wounded.\n- Dave Schreiner was mortally wounded in a later conflict than that ground assault.",
